<title>USA: Health Fitness CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>Health Fitness CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Health Fitness Corp said Tuesday that Don Cochran, the chief financial officer since January, has left the company to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>The company said it named Charles Bidwell, the former chief financial officer, to succeed Cochran.  </p>
<p>The company said Bidwell has served in various capacities over the past seven years and is currently a member of the board of directors.</p>
<p>Health Fitness is a preventive and rehabilitative healthcare company.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
